WEBVTT

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:35.110
Sepia Triangle

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.990
Onii-chan!

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.610
Onii-chan!

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:40.990
Let's go home together!

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:44.510
You go on ahead. I've
still got work to do.

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:45.680
I'll wait for you.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.350
I don't know when I'll finish.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.550
Fine. Come home soon.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:53.520
Okay.

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:54.730
Bye.

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.730
How is the public servant examination
coming along?

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.550
I'm managing.

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:11.380
I have a question regarding
what we discussed earlier.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:12.310
Yes.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.750
What is your response?

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.940
Uh...

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:18.620
You are currently employed
as a student teacher...

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:22.170
but both the other teachers and students
think very highly of you.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:27.110
We would be delighted to have
you teach at our school.

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:28.520
Thank you.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.790
Please give your answer
careful consideration.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.700
I will. Excuse me.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:37.560
Oh, have you heard about
the special speaker?

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:38.900
Special speaker?

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:46.270
Here at Nadesico we invite famous
individuals to come speak.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:50.350
As an upcoming ambitious
young artist...

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:53.280
I am having our next guest
visit the art club as well.

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.130
Here!

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.170
Right in front of you!

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.310
Pass it!

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:20.900
Nice shot.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.280
Thanks.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:25.410
Good work!

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.790
I'm hungry.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.220
Nice work!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:29.370
Kiri-chan.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.920
Where are you off to in such a hurry?

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.980
You guys are like peas in a pod.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.170
What's going on between
the three of you?

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.470
What do you mean?

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:37.260
Are you two-timing?

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.430
Having it both ways?

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:39.860
Is it a love triangle?

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.410
Hey! We're just childhood friends.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.070
It's nothing like that.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.720
So who are you going to choose?

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.190
You should let them know.

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:50.410
It'd be a shame to lose either one.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.110
It's a tough decision.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:54.550
I told you, it's not like that!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.430
She's not being honest.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.870
We know she's already
made up her mind.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.970
We can tell.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.550
Kiri can be so single-minded.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:04.960
Art Room

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:06.290
Kiri-chan.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.510
Thanks for waiting. Let's eat.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.460
Okay.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:16.450
If you don't need any, I'll eat it all.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.760
That looks delicious.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:25.140
Eat with us, Hiroki.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.610
Sure.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:31.680
Huh?

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.200
I don't believe it.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.800
Thanks for the food.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.030
Eat lots.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.060
This is great.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:44.920
Really?

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.230
Thanks for doing this all the time.

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.540
It makes no difference whether
I'm cooking for one...

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.400
or cooking for three.

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:52.350
How's your painting coming along?

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:57.620
If I don't finish my under drawing
soon it won't be finished on time.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:04.720
It's this fall, isn't it? The National
Amateur Art Show.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.660
Yeah, I just can't choose a
subject I'm happy with.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:09.430
I see.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.590
What?

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.520
This won't do at all!

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.970
What am I going to do?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:20.300
Seems everyone else is
having trouble, too.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:23.970
Some of them headed to the beach or
the mountains... to find a subject.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:33.800
Hey, why don't we go to the beach
or the mountains, then?

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.290
The three of us can go together!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.610
I'm sure you'll find something
good there.

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:38.530
Sounds great!

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:39.480
Doesn't it?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.480
What do you think, Hiroki?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.290
I don't have time for that.

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.770
Hey, Kiri-chan.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:44.420
Yeah?

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.160
You've got to be right.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.350
Getting outside would be
a good change of pace.

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.710
Yeah.

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:52.600
I think it'd be a lot of
fun to go together.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:56.210
I guess I can go if you want.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.670
Let's go!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.390
What's with the attitude?

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:01.610
If you don't want to come,
you don't have to.

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:03.320
I'll just go with Shin-chan.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:04.610
What?

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:08.000
Kiri-chan, quit joking around.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.010
But Hiroki always takes forever
to decide what he wants.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.510
He never gives a straight answer.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:21.070
He's late! What is he doing?

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.380
There he is!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.030
Onii-chan!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:32.970
Sorry. I was on my way out when she...

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:35.660
I'm coming, too!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.780
I told you, we're not going to play.

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:42.040
We're going to paint something
very important.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.760
Are you painting too, Kiri-san?

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:47.920
Huh? I'm guess I'm going
as their manager.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.930
I'll be your manager, too!

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.090
Elis! I said no!

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:59.050
Elis-chan, we'll bring you back
a souvenir so wait here, okay?

00:06:59.050 --> 00:06:59.960
Okay!

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:03.120
What, you'll listen to Yanagi?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.700
See you later, Elis-chan.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.380
We'll be back later.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:12.910
Stay out of trouble.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.030
Don't treat me like a little kid!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:29.130
Onii-chan, come back soon!

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.160
Looks good.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:08.830
You think so?

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:10.170
Yeah, it's great.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:13.960
I'm glad you think so. How's yours?

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:18.310
I'm hopeless. Nothing's coming to me.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.890
Well, you are a genius.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.750
I wouldn't say that...

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:25.260
I've got no choice but
to steadily work at it.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.260
We came all the way out here to sketch.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:31.920
I really want to win at the National
Amateur Art Show.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.290
You're amazing.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.820
There's nothing amazing about me.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:39.360
I just love painting.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.660
You're not going to sleep yet?

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.600
Not for a little bit.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:49.330
Do you mind?

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.110
No.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:57.360
You're going to a local public
school, aren't you?

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.610
Yeah, I'm thinking of becoming
a PE teacher.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.430
What about you, Shin-chan? You're
going to Tokyo, right?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.880
I'd like to, but...

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:08.930
I'm sure you can do it.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:16.180
Kiri-chan...

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.150
Even after we graduate, I...

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.670
Graduation, huh?

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:27.380
This is our last summer vacation.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.080
Once we graduate, we'll
go our separate ways.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:36.480
What will we be doing
this time next year?

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.490
I guess that was kind of dark.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:51.030
No, we'll always be friends even if
we part ways after graduation.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.280
Friends...

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:57.940
Yeah. The three of us will
always be friends.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:02.870
Friends...

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:08.980
We'll always be friends forever?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:13.550
Yeah, we'll always be friends...

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:18.460
Always friends...

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:25.800
Kiri, Yanagi and I have
always been together.

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.000
The three of us will always be together.

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:34.310
I believed things would
always be the same...

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:54.020
What? Are you looking for a fight?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.960
Do you like someone?

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.780
Huh?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.610
I guess...

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.050
Are you going out with her?

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.080
No...

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:24.300
That means I still have a chance.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:29.190
This isn't like you.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:32.060
If you've got something
to say, just say it.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.830
Just be patient.

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:39.370
I'm not ready yet.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.870
I like you.

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:48.350
I like you, Hiroki.

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:13.770
Say something.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.310
Sorry.

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.010
Are you on your way to your club?

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:40.170
Yeah.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:40.960
Later.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:41.600
See you later.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.580
Kamikura, Yanagi finished his sketch.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.320
Take a look. It's a good painting.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.510
You're finished?

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:09.140
This guy wouldn't show me his work.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:11.840
Really? Take a look.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:13.850
It's Yanagi's greatest work.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.830
Good, isn't it?

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.670
This one could take you
to some great places.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:26.980
If you win, you'll receive a scholarship
to a Tokyo art school.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.530
I'm looking forward to seeing
the completed work.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:23.400
Kamikura, you should hurry
and finish yours, too.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.880
Why haven't you asked me anything?

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.690
I stole your painting!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:53.260
National Amateur Art Show

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.370
National Amateur Art Show
first place awarded to

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.370
Sakuragaoka High School junior
Yanagi Shinichiro-san

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.450
Yanagi Shinichiro-san claims first place in
this year's National Amateur Art Show!!

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:24.590
Well done!

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.650
Now you'll be able to attend
an art school in Tokyo.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:30.020
You're guaranteed to become
a professional artist now!

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:30.900
Yes.

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:34.840
Hiroki!

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:38.170
Why didn't you submit anything?

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:39.830
If you'd submitted something,
you would have...

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.480
I didn't make the deadline!

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:45.050
I've got to run.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:59.770
You're going to Tokyo too, Hiroki?

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:03.370
Yeah. I'm taking a year off and then
going to an art prep school.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.040
Hiroki, I'm determined
to become an artist.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.570
I was determined to go to
a Tokyo art school...

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:13.890
but we didn't have the money.

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.150
Just forget about it.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.740
When I saw your painting,
I felt like I had lost.

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:20.360
It was amazing.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.810
I thought you could win
with that painting.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.090
That's why I...

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:29.230
This will be our secret.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.510
I... I...

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:42.300
I didn't want to lose Kiri-chan to you...

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:47.140
Graduation Ceremony

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.080
Hiroki didn't come.

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:52.250
Yeah.

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:11.410
I'll win this year's National
Amateur Art Show.

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:14.050
I'm better than Yanagi.

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:16.800
I'll win, and then...

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:20.680
Sakuragaoka High School Reunion

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:32.790
National Amateur Art
Show winner chosen

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.550
See you later.

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.030
Kiri...

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:09.090
Is this Kamikura-san's residence?

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.540
If so, please call Kikyo back.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:12.820
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:16.330
Kamikura, come on over.

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:19.080
We're having tons of fun here.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.310
I'll never paint again.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.150
Never.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:10.410
Good to see you again, Hiroki.

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:24.810
You...

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:27.050
Yanagi.

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:14.720
Dark navy is a color wandering
in darkness.

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:18.110
The color that casts light
and shadows on youth.

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.480
Hey, Hiroki...

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:23.060
Why are men such proud creatures?

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:25.560
It's all about winning or losing with men!

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:27.290
What are you talking about?

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:30.050
You're not a fiery character.

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.320
Next episode, “Dark Navy Secret.”

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:35.080
A loss in love is actually a victory!

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:38.550
I'm not a loser!
